Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,I have been lying\Nunder my blankets for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.18,0:00:06.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,three hours, frozen\Nstiff in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.58,0:00:09.11,Cap,,0,0,0,,It is five thirty in\Nthe morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.13,0:00:11.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,and the copper smell\Nof blood
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.38,0:00:14.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,in my bedroom is\Nmaking me gag.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.08,0:00:17.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,Across the room, my\Ndead parents are
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.29,0:00:20.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,propped upright,\Nstaring straight into
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.68,0:00:23.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,my face with wide,\Nlifeless eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.92,0:00:27.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,And right now, the\Nthing that killed them
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.04,0:00:29.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,is crouched beneath my\Nmattress.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.78,0:00:31.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,Let us go back to the\Nbeginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:34.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,At two thirty in the\Nmorning,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.10,0:00:36.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,a violent scream tore\Nthrough
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.20,0:00:38.43,Cap,,0,0,0,,the far end of the\Nhallway.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.45,0:00:41.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,I woke up in a cold\Nsweat, sitting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.24,0:00:44.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,upright with my heart\Nhammering.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.17,0:00:46.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,Before investigating,\NI stopped
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.62,0:00:48.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,in the bathroom first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.66,0:00:51.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,That careless detour\Nwas the only reason
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.80,0:00:54.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,I did not walk into\Nslaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:57.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,Stepping back out, I\Nfelt cold
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.24,0:00:59.73,Cap,,0,0,0,,dampness on my bare\Nfeet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.75,0:01:02.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,Dark streaks trailed\Nacross the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.12,0:01:04.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,hallway carpet toward\Nmy door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.72,0:01:07.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,Panicked, I bolted\Ninto my bedroom
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.55,0:01:10.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,and threw myself\Nbeneath my sheets,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.47,0:01:13.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,praying it was only a\Nnightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.59,0:01:16.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,Minutes later, my\Nbedroom hinges
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.26,0:01:18.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,groaned in the\Nsilence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.48,0:01:21.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,Peeking from under my\Nblanket, I saw a
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.98,0:01:25.63,Cap,,0,0,0,,tall, hairless entity\Nwith pale leathery
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.65,0:01:28.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,skin and hollow,\Neyeless sockets.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.98,0:01:30.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,It was dragging my\Nparents
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.51,0:01:32.11,Cap,,0,0,0,,through the doorway.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:34.73,Cap,,0,0,0,,With calm, horrifying\Nprecision,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.75,0:01:37.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,it propped my father\Nagainst
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.05,0:01:39.79,Cap,,0,0,0,,the foot of my bed,\Nfacing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.81,0:01:42.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then it seated my\Nmother in
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.08,0:01:44.09,Cap,,0,0,0,,my desk chair, her\Nmouth
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.11,0:01:46.65,Cap,,0,0,0,,wide open in the\Nshadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.67,0:01:49.55,Cap,,0,0,0,,Next, the creature\Ndipped its clawed
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.57,0:01:52.67,Cap,,0,0,0,,hands into dark fluid\Non the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.69,0:01:56.31,Cap,,0,0,0,,It smeared ritualistic\Nshapes across my
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.33,0:01:59.59,Cap,,0,0,0,,bedroom walls, and\Ngouged a line of
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.61,0:02:03.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,words into the plaster\Nabove my desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.51,0:02:05.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,When it finished, it\Nslithered
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.76,0:02:08.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,beneath my bed like a\Nspider.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.22,0:02:11.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,I felt the wooden\Nslats beneath my
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.02,0:02:13.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,mattress sag under its\Nweight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.78,0:02:16.65,Cap,,0,0,0,,It has been down there\Nfor three hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.67,0:02:19.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,waiting for me to wake\Nup.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.05,0:02:21.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,Now, pre-dawn light is\Ncreeping
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.23,0:02:22.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,through my window.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.80,0:02:25.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,My eyes have adjusted\Nto the gloom,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.64,0:02:27.73,Cap,,0,0,0,,and I can finally read\Nthe
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.75,0:02:30.23,Cap,,0,0,0,,carved message on the\Nwall.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.25,0:02:34.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,Four simple words: I\Nknow you are awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.09,0:02:36.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,Inspired by the\Ncreepypasta
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.16,0:02:38.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,I Know You're Awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.14,0:02:39.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,Would you have looked\Nunder the bed?
